OverTheWire Bandit: Level 14 → 15

Objective
Retrieve the password for Level 15.
The password for the next level must be submitted to a service running on localhost port 30000 using plain text.

Steps
Log in as bandit14:
ssh bandit14@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
Send the Level 14 password to the local service using nc:
nc localhost 30000
Paste the password for Bandit 14 and press Enter.

Result
The service returns the password for Bandit Level 15.
